\"line2\":\"Orpington\",\"city\":\"Kent\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00007459\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Running Man\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In a near-future society, The Running Man is the top-rated show on television—a deadly competition where contestants, known as Runners, must survive 30 days while being hunted by professional assassins, with every move broadcast to a bloodthirsty public and each day bringing a greater cash reward. Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards (Glen Powell) is convinced by the show’s charming but ruthless producer, Dan Killian (Josh Brolin), to enter the game as a last resort. But Ben’s defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favourite—and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters but a nation addicted to watching him fall.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In a near-future society, The Running Man is the top-rated show on television—a deadly competition where contestants, known as Runners, must survive 30 days.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, language, brief sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-11\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":133,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ByXAgJU_X2M\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001038\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002031\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010192\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015891\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015892\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"4068\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000216\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001054\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001620\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001746\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001747\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001845\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002426\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e33681b9-a8e3-4ed7-a24a-c9ba36d92dd9\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007459\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008485\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007462\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Predator: Badlands\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"20th Century Studios’ “Predator: Badlands,” directed by Dan Trachtenberg (“Prey”), opens exclusively in theaters November 7, 2025. The newest entry in the “Predator” franchise is set in the future on a remote planet, where a young Predator, outcast from his clan, finds an unlikely ally in Thia (Elle Fanning) and embarks on a treacherous journey in search of the ultimate adversary. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The newest entry in the “Predator” franchise is set in the future on a remote planet, where a young Predator, outcast from his clan, finds an unlikely ally.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":107,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015893\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015894\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000002\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001908\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"14a05d1a-67dd-4361-816f-7dd581bf53ef\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007462\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008488\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007519\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Now You See Me: Now You Don’t\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The Four Horsemen return along with a new generation of illusionists performing mind-melding twists, turns, surprises, and magic unlike anything ever captured on film.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The Four Horsemen return along with a new generation of illusionists performing mind-melding twists, turns, surprises, and magic unlike anything ever captured on film.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, injury detail, sex reference, infrequent strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-12\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":112,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIi8uwkqsaU\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000455\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000884\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002333\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002786\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004482\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010954\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"2561\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000090\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000542\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000544\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001281\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001717\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"641fbef0-1dc3-4a0f-a0b9-c209e1847de5\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007519\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008549\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"LIONSGATE INTERNATIONAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007828\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Bugonia\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-31\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GYanIV0BNyY\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001319\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002864\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003304\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004704\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009010\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016597\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016598\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016599\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016600\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000255\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001606\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001960\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"6c78cc0b-e1f4-4fe4-9a8f-9abb75dc08bf\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007828\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008885\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007830\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Choral\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"1916. As war rages on the Western Front, the Choral Society in Ramsden, Yorkshire has lost most of its men to the army. The Choral’s ambitious committee, determined to press ahead, decides to recruit local young males to swell their ranks. They must also engage a new chorus master, and despite their suspicions that he has something to hide, their best bet seems to be Dr. Henry Guthrie (Ralph Fiennes) – driven, uncompromising, and recently returned from a career in Germany. As conscription papers start to arrive, the whole community discovers that the best response to the chaos that is laying waste to their lives is to make music together.\\n\\n \\n\\nDirected by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner NICHOLAS HYTNER (The Crucible) and written by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner ALAN BENNETT, The Choral marks their fourth writer-director collaboration following the acclaimed films The Madness of King George, The History Boys, and The Lady in The Van.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"1916. As war rages on the Western Front, the Choral Society in Ramsden, Yorkshire has lost most of its men to the army. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":113,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6zRVP-ZgMm8\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000456\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001181\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002690\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016601\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016602\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000061\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000446\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000914\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000024\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2d11e861-3222-4621-b9ca-ef1884f57c6f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007830\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008887\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SONY PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007886\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Die My Love\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From renowned filmmaker Lynne Ramsay, DIE MY LOVE is a visceral and uncompromising portrait of a woman engulfed by love and madness. Anchored by a ferocious, tour de force performance from Jennifer Lawrence, and co-starring Robert Pattinson. \\nThe film follows Grace (Lawrence) and her partner Jackson (Pattinson), who have recently moved into an old house deep in the country. With ambitions to write The Great American Novel, Grace settles into her new environment, and the couple welcome a baby soon after. However, with Jackson frequently – and suspiciously – absent, and the pressures of domestic life starting to weigh on her, Grace begins to unravel, leaving a path of destruction in her wake. \\nBased on Ariana Harwicz’s celebrated novel and co-starring Sissy Spacek, LaKeith Stanfield and Nick Nolte, Ramsay marks her eagerly-awaited return with this fearless new cinematic vision that charts the complexity of love and how it can change and transform over time. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From renowned filmmaker Lynne Ramsay, DIE MY LOVE is a visceral and uncompromising portrait of a woman engulfed by love and madness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mental health theme, strong sex, nudity, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":119,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":6,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000150\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000578\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003663\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014891\",\"roles